title: "GH-1386: remove conflicting global output projection from get recovery retries"
description: "Reported on installed 2026.10.4: get --full combined with global --output-include emits suggested_retry identical to the rejected invocation. Preserve tracker/JSON scope and unrelated options while removing one conflicting selector or withholding an ambiguous retry. Intake only; this combined delivery has not independently reproduced or implemented this newly arrived report."
